; left:456.88pt; top:2.83pt; line-height:11.17pt;">13</span><div class="awdiv" style="left:-1.45pt; top:0pt; width:470.9pt; height:0pt; border-top:solid 1.5pt #000000;"></div></div><div class="awdiv" style="left:72pt; top:72pt;"><a name="_Toc508955490" style="left:0pt; top:0pt;"></a><span class="awspan awtext001" style="font-size:14pt; left:0pt; top:0.46pt; line-height:15.64pt;">Adding Expense</span><div class="awdiv" style="top:19.1pt;"><span class="awspan awtext003" style="left:0pt; top:0.39pt; line-height:13.41pt;">You can add an expense by clicking on the </span><span class="awspan awtext002" style="left:231.49pt; top:0.39pt; line-height:13.41pt;">Add Expense </span><span class="awspan awtext003" style="left:310.85pt; top:0.39pt; line-height:13.41pt;">option and the below page is </span><span class="awspan awtext003" style="left:0pt; top:14.19pt; line-height:13.41pt;">displayed.</span></div><div class="awdiv" style="top:46.7pt;"><span class="awspan awtext003" style="left:0pt; top:0.39pt; line-height:13.41pt;">Click on </span><span class="awspan awtext002" style="left:46.01pt; top:0.39pt; line-height:13.41pt;">Add Item </span><span class="awspan awtext003" style="left:100.68pt; top:0.39pt; line-height:13.41pt;">after filling the details into the required fields. The item is listed under </span><span class="awspan awtext003" style="left:0pt; top:14.19pt; line-height:13.41pt;">the Expenses list. </span></div><div class="awdiv" style="top:207.77pt;"><a name="_Toc508955491" style="left:0pt; top:0pt;"></a><span class="awspan awtext001" style="font-size:16pt; left:0pt; top:12.52pt; line-height:17.88pt;">Dashboard View</span></div><div class="awdiv" style="top:254.97pt;"><span class="awspan awtext003" style="left:0pt; top:0.39pt; line-height:13.41pt;">The Dashboard displays the </span><span class="awspan awtext002" style="left:152.76pt; top:0.39pt; line-height:13.41pt;">Expenses </span><span class="awspan awtext003" style="left:212.12pt; top:0.39pt; line-height:13.41pt;">as a widget with </span><span class="awspan awtext002" style="left:300.83pt; top:0.39pt; line-height:13.41pt;">Self </span><span class="awspan awtext003" style="left:326.18pt; top:0.39pt; line-height:13.41pt;">and </span><span class="awspan awtext002" style="left:349.53pt; top:0.39pt; line-height:13.41pt;">Employees </span><span class="awspan awtext003" style="left:416.23pt; top:0.39pt; line-height:13.41pt;">expenses </span><span class="awspan awtext003" style="left:0pt; top:14.19pt; line-height:13.41pt;">status. You can view the status of submitted expenses under this page as displayed </span><span class="awspan awtext003" style="left:0pt; top:27.99pt; line-height:13.41pt;">below.</span></div><div class="awdiv" style="top:454.46pt;"><span class="awspan awtext005" style="left:0pt; top:12.39pt; line-height:13.41pt;">Expense Approval</span></div><div class="awdiv" style="top:483.26pt;"><span class="awspan awtext003" style="left:0pt; top:0.39pt; line-height:13.41pt;">Click Approve Action to approve the employee expenses. </span></div><div class="awdiv" style="top:497.06pt;"><span class="awspan awtext003" style="left:0pt; top:0.39pt; line-height:13.41pt;">Approved:</span></div><div class="awdiv" style="left:36pt; top:510.86pt;"><span class="awspan awtext006" style="left:0pt; top:1.66pt; line-height:12pt;"></span><span class="awspan awtext003" style="left:18pt; top:0.39pt; line-height:13.41pt;">If manager1 approves the expenses then mail will be sent to manager2.</span></div><div class="awdiv" style="left:36pt; top:524.66pt;"><span class="awspan awtext006" style="left:0pt; top:1.66pt; line-height:12pt;"></span><span class="awspan awtext003" style="left:18pt; top:0.39pt; line-height:13.41pt;">If manager2 approves the expenses then approval mail will be sent to </span><span class="awspan awtext003" style="left:18pt; top:14.19pt; line-height:13.41pt;">employee </span></div><div class="awdiv" style="top:552.26pt;"><span class="awspan awtext003" style="left:0pt; top:0.39pt; line-height:13.41pt;">Click Reject Action to reject the employee expenses. </span></div></div><div class="awdiv" style="left:72pt; top:146.3pt;"><div class="awdiv" style="left:1.5pt; top:1.5pt;"><img class="awimg" style="left:0pt; top:0pt; width:468pt; height:129.98pt;" src="data:image/png;base64," /><div class="awdiv" style="left:-0.75pt; top:-0.75pt;"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" version="1.1" width="626" height="175"><defs /><g><g transform="translate(1,1)"><path d="M-0.5,-0.5 L624.5,-0.5 L624.5,-0.5 L624.5,173.8002 L624.5,173.8002 L-0.5,173.8002 Z" stroke-width="1" stroke-miterlimit="10.66667" stroke="#000000" fill="none" fill-rule="evenodd" /></g></g></svg></div></div></div><div class="awdiv" style="left:72pt; top:382.16pt;"><div class="awdiv" style="left:1.5pt; top:1.5pt;"><img class="awimg" style="left:0pt; top:0pt; width:399.25pt; height:127.15pt;" src="data:image/png;base64," /><div class="awdiv" style="left:-0.75pt; top:-0.75pt;"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" version="1.1" width="534" height="172"><defs /><g><g transform="translate(1,1)"><path d="M-0.5,-0.5 L532.8333,-0.5 L532.8333,-0.5 L532.8333,170.0333 L532.8333,170.0333 L-0.5,170.0333 Z" stroke-width="1" stroke-miterlimit="10.66667" stroke="#000000" fill="none" fill-rule="evenodd" /></g></g></svg></div></div></div></div><div class="awdiv awpage" style="width:612pt; height:792pt;"><div class="awdiv" style="left:72pt; top:36pt; clip:rect(0pt,540pt,26.3pt,-72pt);"><span class="awspan awtext002" style="font-size:10pt; left:318.5pt; top:14.13pt; line-height:11.17pt;">Sourcelead – Expenses Module</span></div><div class="awdiv" style="left:72pt; top:742pt; clip:rect(0pt,540pt,15pt,-72pt);"><span class="awspan awtext002" style="font-size:10pt; left:0pt; top:2.83pt; line-height:11.17pt;">Quick Reference Guide</span><span class="awspan awtext002" style="font-size:10pt; left:456.88pt; top:2.83pt; line-height:11.17pt;">14</span><div class="awdiv" style="left:-1.45pt; top:0pt; width:470.9pt; height:0pt; border-top:solid 1.5pt #000000;"></div></div><div class="awdiv" style="left:72pt; top:72pt;"><div class="awdiv" style="top:277.8pt;"><span class="awspan awtext003" style="left:0pt; top:0.39pt; line-height:13.41pt;">Enter comment enter rejecting purposes comment. Click Submit to reject the expenses </span><span class="awspan awtext003" style="left:0pt; top:14.19pt; line-height:13.41pt;">with comment. Click Cancel Comment box will be closed. Rejected Stage If any of the </span><span class="awspan awtext003" style="left:0pt; top:27.99pt; line-height:13.41pt;">level managers rejects the expenses then reject mail will be sent to employee. Reject </span><span class="awspan awtext003" style="left:0pt; top:41.79pt; line-height:13.41pt;">Comment to view the rejected reason. </span></div></div><div class="awdiv" style="left:72pt; top:72pt;"><div class="awdiv" style="left:1.5pt; top:1.5pt;"><img class="awimg" style="left:0pt; top:0pt; width:468pt; height:261.05pt;" src="data:image/png;base64," /><div class="awdiv" style="left:-0.75pt; top:-0.75pt;"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" version="1.1" width="626" height="350"><defs /><g><g transform="translate(1,1)"><path d="M-0.5,-0.5 L624.5,-0.5 L624.5,-0.5 L624.5,348.5667 L624.5,348.5667 L-0.5,348.5667 Z" stroke-width="1" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-miterlimit="13.33333" stroke="#000000" fill="none" fill-rule="evenodd" /></g></g></svg></div></div></div><div class="awdiv" style="left:72pt; top:418.79pt;"><div class="awdiv" style="left:1.5pt; top:1.5pt;"><img class="awimg" style="left:0pt; top:0pt; width:468pt; height:261.05pt;" src="data:image/png;base64," /><div class="awdiv" style="left:-0.75pt; top:-0.75pt;"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" version="1.1" width="626" height="350"><defs /><g><g transform="translate(1,1)"><path d="M-0.5,-0.5 L624.5,-0.5 L624.5,-0.5 L624.5,348.5667 L624.5,348.5667 L-0.5,348.5667 Z" stroke-width="1" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-miterlimit="13.33333" stroke="#000000" fill="none" fill-rule="evenodd" /></g></g></svg></div></div></div></div><div class="awdiv awpage" style="width:612pt; height:792pt;"><div class="awdiv" style="left:72pt; top:36pt; clip:rect(0pt,540pt,26.3pt,-72pt);"><span class="awspan awtext002" style="font-size:10pt; left:318.5pt; top:14.13pt; line-height:11.17pt;">Sourcelead – Expenses Module</span></div><div class="awdiv" style="left:72pt; top:742pt; clip:rect(0pt,540pt,15pt,-72pt);"><span class="awspan awtext002" style="font-size:10pt; left:0pt; top:2.83pt; line-height:11.17pt;">Quick Reference Guide</span><span class="awspan awtext002" style="font-size:10pt; left:456.88pt; top:2.83pt; line-height:11.17pt;">15</span><div class="awdiv" style="left:-1.45pt; top:0pt; width:470.9pt; height:0pt; border-top:solid 1.5pt #000000;"></div></div><div class="awdiv" style="left:72pt; top:72pt;"><span class="awspan awtext003" style="left:0pt; top:0.39pt; line-height:13.41pt;">Click RE-OPEN to reopen the employee timesheet. </span><div class="awdiv" style="top:291.6pt;"><span class="awspan awtext003" style="left:0pt; top:0.39pt; line-height:13.41pt;">Enter Comment Enter reason to reopen expenses. Click Submit Expenses will change </span><span class="awspan awtext003" style="left:0pt; top:14.19pt; line-height:13.41pt;">to draft stage. Click Cancel Comment box will be closed. Re-open Comment to view the </span><span class="awspan awtext003" style="left:0pt; top:27.99pt; line-height:13.41pt;">reopen reason. </span></div></div><div class="awdiv" style="left:72pt; top:99.6pt;"><div class="awdiv" style="left:1.5pt; top:1.5pt;"><img class="awimg" style="left:0pt; top:0pt; width:468pt; height:261.05pt;" src="data:image/png;base64," /><div class="awdiv" style="left:-0.75pt; top:-0.75pt;"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" version="1.1" width="626" height="350"><defs /><g><g transform="translate(1,1)"><path d="M-0.5,-0.5 L624.5,-0.5 L624.5,-0.5 L624.5,348.5667 L624.5,348.5667 L-0.5,348.5667 Z" stroke-width="1" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-miterlimit="13.33333" stroke="#000000" fill="none" fill-rule="evenodd" /></g></g></svg></div></div></div><div class="awdiv" style="left:72pt; top:405pt;"><div class="awdiv" style="left:1.5pt; top:1.5pt;"><img class="awimg" style="left:0pt; top:0pt; width:468pt; height:261.05pt;" src="data:image/png;base64," /><div class="awdiv" style="left:-0.75pt; top:-0.75pt;"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" version="1.1" width="626" height="350"><defs /><g><g transform="translate(1,1)"><path d="M-0.5,-0.5 L624.5,-0.5 L624.5,-0.5 L624.5,348.5667 L624.5,348.5667 L-0.5,348.5667 Z" stroke-width="1" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-miterlimit="13.33333" stroke="#000000" fill="none" fill-rule="evenodd" /></g></g></svg></div></div></div></div><div class="awdiv awpage" style="width:612pt; height:792pt;"><div class="awdiv" style="left:72pt; top:36pt; clip:rect(0pt,540pt,26.3pt,-72pt);"><span class="awspan awtext002" style="font-size:10pt; left:318.5pt; top:14.13pt; line-height:11.17pt;">Sourcelead – Expenses Module</span></div><div class="awdiv" style="left:72pt; top:742pt; clip:rect(0pt,540pt,15pt,-72pt);"><span class="awspan awtext002" style="font-size:10pt; left:0pt; top:2.83pt; line-height:11.17pt;">Quick Reference Guide</span><span class="awspan awtext002" style="font-size:10pt; left:456.88pt; top:2.83pt; line-height:11.17pt;">16</span><div class="awdiv" style="left:-1.45pt; top:0pt; width:470.9pt; height:0pt; border-top:solid 1.5pt #000000;"></div></div><div class="awdiv" style="left:72pt; top:72pt;"><span class="awspan awtext003" style="left:0pt; top:0.39pt; line-height:13.41pt;">Click Add Expense from here onwards we can add employee expenses. Click Filter It </span><span class="awspan awtext003" style="left:0pt; top:14.19pt; line-height:13.41pt;">shows the filter list based on selected status. Click Submit Based on start date &amp; end </span><span class="awspan awtext003" style="left:0pt; top:27.99pt; line-height:13.41pt;">date, expenses will be displayed. Search to search the expenses from the list. Approved </span><span class="awspan awtext003" style="left:0pt; top:41.79pt; line-height:13.41pt;">Action Expenses in approved stage will be displayed here.</span><div class="awdiv" style="top:55.2pt;"><span class="awspan awtext003" style="left:0pt; top:0.39pt; line-height:13.41pt;">Click Rejected from the Dashboard to view the expenses in rejected stage. </span></div></div><div class="awdiv" style="left:72pt; top:154.79pt;"><div class="awdiv" style="left:1.5pt; top:1.5pt;"><img class="awimg" style="left:0pt; top:0pt; width:468pt; height:261.05pt;" src="data:image/png;base64," /><div class="awdiv" style="left:-0.75pt; top:-0.75pt;"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" version="1.1" width="626" height="350"><defs /><g><g transform="translate(1,1)"><path d="M-0.5,-0.5 L624.5,-0.5 L624.5,-0.5 L624.5,348.5667 L624.5,348.5667 L-0.5,348.5667 Z" stroke-width="1" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-miterlimit="13.33333" stroke="#000000" fill="none" fill-rule="evenodd" /></g></g></svg></div></div></div></div></body></html>